{"server":"cn","storyId":"act22side_level_act22side_05_end","groupId":"act22side","stageId":"act22side_05","title":"祝福的歌谣","storyCode":"FC-5","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act22side/level_act22side_05_end.txt","sourceHash":"7cb0f500719d95996e4c971651a08a88b7b2ca338f250e3029504d04495477cc","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g9_tent"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，快跑！这边也有人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"该死，他们是不是把这片空地都围起来了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特别行动队士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"别动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好，我、我不动......您的刀，有点太近了......您不会失手吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"救、救命啊苇草，我们怎么办？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......面对这么多人，很难强行突破。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......啊......棍子被砍断了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他们，很有信心，"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不想暴力抓捕我们，只是想压制住我们的抵抗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，这些人的身手也挺不赖的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我想不明白，能追到这里，他们是什么来历？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——等等，我见过那个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在几天前，我们遇到那一队“鬼魂士兵”的时候。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特别行动队队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么说，你们不是特伦特郡的驻军，不该越权来逮捕这些流民的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们这样不守规矩的话，我们也只好动真格了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特别行动队队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“不守规矩”这个词，对你也一样适用。既然你的破城矛已经卸掉弹药，你就应该远离战场，士兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，这里本来就不该是战场呀？篝火都还没有熄灭呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑色的匕首无声地滑出，尖刃没有反射出寒光，而是划出一道烟雾。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"匕首仅仅威胁性地指向风笛的喉咙，而握着它的人从始至终，视线都停留在苇草身上。\n苇草从对方那双锐利的眼睛里清晰地读出，这一切都是冲着自己而来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的长枪上，不该燃烧着火焰吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起徒劳地抵抗，我更希望你能够明智地选择放下武器，听我说明来意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我对塔拉人没有敌意，更不打算伤害平民以示报复。在保护大众免于祸端的立场上，我与你们应该是站在一起的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是政府文件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，市议会的调查令？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"前维多利亚士兵放下了手中的武器。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"依照特伦特郡市议会的决定，我将对一桩纵火案里被人遗漏的疑点进行调查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我，没有别的选择，对吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的塔拉流民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呜，呜呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看守士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"——干什么？安静点。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的塔拉流民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......（抽泣）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（唉，真难受。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我过去一直想，要死的话，至少该先写好遗书......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"（要我说，你早该写了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（刚逃出来的时候是写了一封，这两天高兴过头了，撕掉了。我真后悔。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（闭嘴，维恩。我们还没完蛋呢。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（人都被绑起来了，能拿来打架的东西也被收走了，我们除了等死还能做什么？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（唉......审讯，审讯这个词多吓人啊。被审讯的塔拉人，我们听说过的，有几个活着回来过？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（苇草那么心善的人，也不知道他们要从她那里问出什么。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我们这些人，互相都是知根知底的，可是苇草她从哪里来，以前干了什么事，我们没人知道。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（怎么，你敢怀疑她？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不不不，我哪有这个意思呀......我只是......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（唉，塞尔蒙，你总不能不许人怕死吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（从这里还能看到篝火的光呢，我们有多少天没见过夜里的火光了？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我真的以为自己逃出来了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"（你还找我商量，借点什么东西做本钱。我是不是答应做一批熏羽兽肉给你拿去卖？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（别说了。我们要想办法去看看情况。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（啊，怎么看？再说，看了又有什么用？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......我就是不甘心。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我就是不喜欢听你只能一个劲儿地叹气。我蹲在塔拉人街区的路口，或者穿过村子的打谷场的时候......到处都是叹气声。我听腻了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（行了，别废话，别问我怎么办，你明明每次都能自己想出办法。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我去吸引那几个看守的注意力，你该做什么，自己想去。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g10_tent_inside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以放松一点，“苇草”，我们只是普通地聊聊天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一堆温暖的篝火，还能听到夜间羽兽的鸣叫，我想这样的环境比真正的审讯室要惬意许多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沉默？你也可以选择沉默，我不会为难你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许之前邻近地区驻军有失尊重的行事方式让你产生了戒心，我替他们向你道歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是想调查深池的事情吗？这里所有人都与深池无关......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用解释，这些情况我当然已经掌握。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个小地方的驻军确实会因为一场袭击而对十几个塔拉人过分计较，随意加以“深池反叛军”的罪名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这厚厚的卷宗里，他们犯的错误不值一提。当然，你与其他人的情况稍有不同......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但我也能想办法帮助你摆脱这些麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟，这一路逃亡，应该很不容易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果没有那些严苛的律令，他们从一开始，就不需要逃跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，既然是我们二人之间的闲聊，我希望你说说你自己的事。说说你从更早以前就开始的逃亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不明白你在说什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在问你，"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曾经的身份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个普通人，没有任何档案记录，医疗体检、进出移动城市、缴纳税金，什么都没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......塔拉人常常被驱赶，维多利亚的记录里看不到我们，不奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，去年秋天小丘郡动乱的时候，你在那里吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去年五月半岛郡遭受袭击的时候，你在那里吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我问的只是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，如果一个人自己都说不出自己本来的名字，说不出自己从哪里来，是什么人的话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是，就像“影子”一样？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g9_tent"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陈陈，你是不是大概猜到这些人的身份了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。方才与我们交手的并非普通士兵，就地审讯也是很特殊的做法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再加上，那个带头的人知道很多，才会对我们......对我如此客气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对欸。我刚刚还在想，他们可以让我们站在这里等着，只是让人看守，但那些塔拉人就要把双手绑起来，好不公平......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可他是怎么认出来你的呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我没想到情报部门的人会出动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情报部门？情报部门为什么会找上苇草？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她应该身份特殊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以她之前执意独自行动，不想牵连谁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我有种不好的感觉......他们真的会好好跟一个塔拉人沟通吗？他们会不会打她，或者威胁她说违心的话？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"轻声些。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，我还记得你那份关于小丘郡的报告书是怎么写的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是呀，虽然那个人有市议会的调查令，也说了会和平沟通，对塔拉人没有敌意什么的，但......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不对，我还是应该相信，他是议会决定的执行者，不会乱来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但审讯的压力，一般人扛不过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你记不记得上学的时候，我们俩搭档，是怎么行动的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你这个手势......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得。那次抢夺高危源石制品的时候，我们用过这套手势交流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"记得就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"苇草她无论是什么特殊身份，只要落在他人手里作为棋子，恐怕都会给现下的局势带来不小的风波。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，她自己也一定会很难过......毕竟她看起来，好像一直想要甩掉自己身上的什么东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白你的意思了，陈陈。我们帮她回罗德岛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g4_swamp_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀......真是清晰的车辙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来你的对手又在邀请你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别这么揶揄我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜，这一次，我恐怕还担不起“邀请”这个词，他甚至不会在乎他的客人要跳一支怎样的舞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们露面这件事，本身就足以说明我们的立场了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"深池去救可怜的拉芙希妮，会暴露她的身份......也会最终证明我站在哪一边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而他也知道，为了不让另一条塔拉的德拉克落入他背后那位公爵手中，降低领袖她德拉克这一身份的影响力......我不得不去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无妨，我会把他的野心清扫干净。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g10_tent_inside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......羽兽的叫声停止了。你知道这意味着什么吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......（摇头）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，先来说说你近期留下的案件记录吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你没有对他人造成过严重伤害。就连那起发生在驻军处的火灾，也只有一些储备物资被烧毁，没有任何人员伤亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一般塔拉人对维多利亚驻军的仇恨犯罪不会如此。相比之下，你的做法很温和。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至有目击者指出你尝试击退深池士兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些，你承认吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只承认，我的确不想伤害他人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我可以相信，你是有相当良知的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，关于那些变得安静的羽兽......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是你深池的朋友们来救你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能回去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回去？哦，你是说，回到作为影子的生活？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回到那种被燃烧的尸体包围、将死者的灰烬洒满城市街道的生活？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对于一个有良知的人而言，那样的生活想必十分痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在你恰好有机会，可以做出属于你自己的选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接受我们的庇护，你过去犯下的罪行不会被追究。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"决不！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g9_tent"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就现在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，但是你们得再试试我破城矛的力量了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"挥动破城矛的风笛没有看向帐篷的方向，但站在她身后的陈在那一瞬间睁大了眼睛。\n遮蔽审讯者的帐篷悄无声息地化为灰烬。\n一道火焰在黑夜中迸发，又立刻无影无踪。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
